[EXAMPLES]
Print all records from a file:

  recsel contacts.rec

Print only Email fields for people in New York:

  recsel -e "City = 'New York'" -p Email contacts.rec

Count the number of Task records:

  recsel -t Task -c todo.rec

Print records 0 through 4, sorted by Name:

  recsel -n 0-4 -S Name contacts.rec

Perform a join on a foreign key field:

  recsel -t Invoice -j Customer billing.rec

